{
  "title": "Anvil / Sandbox",
  "uid": "anvil-sandbox",
  "tags": ["anvil"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Active sandboxes",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "anvil_sandbox_active" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Create / exec duration (p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(anvil_sandbox_create_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))", "legendFormat": "create p95" },
        { "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(anvil_sandbox_exec_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))", "legendFormat": "exec p95" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "title": "Timeout kills",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "rate(anvil_sandbox_timeout_kills_total[15m])" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "Policy denials by tool and rule",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum by (tool, rule) (rate(anvil_policy_denials_total[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{tool}} / {{rule}}" }]
    },
    {
      "title": "OOM kills & egress denials",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Not wired yet.** PRD §17.2 documents `anvil_sandbox_oom_kills_total` and `anvil_egress_denials_total`, but nothing in this codebase currently detects an OOM kill or denies egress — the allowlist proxy that would emit the latter is BUILD-PLAN Week 11, task 11.3. Add both panels back (querying those exact metric names — see internal/sandbox/metrics.go's own doc comment) once that work lands, instead of shipping a panel that's always empty."
      }
    }
  ]
}
